---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<Layout title={"Niranjana — Projects"}>
<div style="min-height: 100vh; background: #f4f4f4; padding: clamp(0px, 3vw, 40px); box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #111111">
<div style="max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 0 clamp(16px, 5vw, 64px); box-sizing: border-box">

<header style="position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 0; margin: 0 calc(-1 * clamp(16px, 5vw, 64px)); padding-left: clamp(16px, 5vw, 64px); padding-right: clamp(16px, 5vw, 64px); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.06)">
<a href={`${base}`} style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; text-decoration: none; color: #111111">
<span aria-hidden="true" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600">NJ</span>
<span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">Niranjana</span>
</a>
<nav aria-label="Primary" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; padding: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(244,244,244,0.55); backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.9)">
<a href={`${base}work/`} class="tab" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: #111111; text-decoration: none">Work</a>
<a href={`${base}projects/`} class="tab" aria-current="page" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #111111; text-decoration: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.10), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1); border: 0.5px solid rgba(17,17,17,0.08)">Projects</a>
<a href={`${base}digital-twin/`} class="tab" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: #111111; text-decoration: none">Digital Twin</a>
</nav>
<a href={`${base}#contact`} style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #111111; text-decoration: none">Contact</a>
</header>

<section aria-labelledby="page-title" style="padding: 64px 0 40px">
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959; margin-bottom: 8px">Projects</div>
<h1 id="page-title" style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; max-width: 22ch">Strategy, research and AI builds outside the day job.</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #595959; max-width: 60ch">Capstones, competitions and things I built to learn how they break.</p>
</section>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 64px 40px; padding: 24px 0 64px">

<article id="pwc" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<a href={`${base}case-studies/pwc/`} aria-label="PwC Capstone case study" style="display: block; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><img src={`${base}images/aafce7ebd934411b3c6081527ead1164.jpg`} alt="" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px"></a>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">PwC × NYU Capstone · Sep – Dec 2025 · Case study</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: 600"><a href={`${base}case-studies/pwc/`} style="text-decoration: none">Emerging tech for supply-chain operations</a></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #595959">We scanned eight emerging technologies with Gartner, IDC and vendor data, scored them on impact and feasibility, and turned the top picks into an executive decision framework for supply chain transformation.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px"><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Strategy</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Market research</span></div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/pwc/`} style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Read the case study →</a>
</article>

<article id="health" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<a href={`${base}case-studies/aira/`} aria-label="AIRA case study" style="display: block; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background: #111111; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center"><img src={`${base}images/114ee24e7cee827e0139e0235d6ab052.jpg`} alt="" style="display: block; height: 80%; width: auto"></div></a>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">NYU · Digital health · Case study</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: 600"><a href={`${base}case-studies/aira/`} style="text-decoration: none">AIRA: a gentle companion for PCOS</a></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #595959">Five interviews, a survey and an endocrinologist conversation showed why women with PCOS abandon trackers. AIRA connects sleep, nutrition, movement, stress and cycle into one supportive ecosystem.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px"><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">User research</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Behavior design</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Mobile</span></div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/aira/`} style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Read the case study →</a>
</article>

<article id="bereal" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<a href={`${base}case-studies/bereal/`} aria-label="Rethinking BeReal case study" style="display: block; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background: #111111; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; overflow: hidden"><img src={`${base}images/3b57da221b22b02b8b08980af6b5e818.jpg`} alt="" style="display: block; height: 90%; width: auto"><img src={`${base}images/9ab3d80d1a1dccd3c6e04e298141f425.jpg`} alt="" style="display: block; height: 90%; width: auto"></div></a>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">Product teardown · 2025 · Case study</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: 600"><a href={`${base}case-studies/bereal/`} style="text-decoration: none">Rethinking BeReal</a></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #595959">Only 15% of the 25+ users we surveyed post daily; most just check in on friends. We redesigned BeReal around small private groups with themes, prompts and shared recaps.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px"><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Teardown</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">User research</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Social</span></div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/bereal/`} style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Read the case study →</a>
</article>

<article id="loop" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<a href={`${base}case-studies/loop/`} aria-label="Loop case study" style="display: block; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><img src={`${base}images/be3d50877b482d2874e03814d7c43047.jpg`} alt="" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px"></a>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">NYU · Product design · Nov 2025 · Case study</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: 600"><a href={`${base}case-studies/loop/`} style="text-decoration: none">Loop: a social app for runners</a></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #595959">57% of runners we surveyed said motivation drops when they train solo, yet most apps only track. Loop connects runners before, during and after races to share progress and celebrate together.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px"><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Survey</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Task flows</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Mobile</span></div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/loop/`} style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Read the case study →</a>
</article>

<article id="creator" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<a href={`${base}case-studies/creator/`} aria-label="Creator economy case study" style="display: block; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><img src={`${base}images/d9068930ad5ab5d392bf6810429ac1ec.jpg`} alt="" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px"></a>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">Strategy project · Case study</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: 600"><a href={`${base}case-studies/creator/`} style="text-decoration: none">Real or not: AI fan trailers and the creator economy</a></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #595959">A studio-governed platform for fan content, with IP licensing, revenue sharing and AI-based rights enforcement. I mapped the flow from creation to attribution, monetization and payout, and compared TikTok, YouTube and Patreon.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px"><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Marketplaces</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Policy UX</span></div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/creator/`} style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Read the case study →</a>
</article>

<article id="agents" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<div style="background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><div aria-hidden="true" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background: #6f8fe0; border-radius: 4px"></div></div>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">Personal build</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: 600">Multi-agent investment system</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #595959">Analyst, researcher and decision-maker agents working together. I designed the workflows, coordination logic and evaluation, and studied the failure modes: where trust and reliability break down between agents.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px"><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Agents</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Evaluation</span></div>
</article>

<article id="egis" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<a href={`${base}case-studies/egis/`} aria-label="EGIS case study" style="display: block; background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px"><img src={`${base}images/ce90d0dc38db9f0bab1bbaa4b6054e56.jpg`} alt="" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px"></a>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; color: #595959">EGIS Innovation Challenge · Jan – May 2025 · Case study</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px; font-weight: 600"><a href={`${base}case-studies/egis/`} style="text-decoration: none">A green roof ecosystem for Brooklyn</a></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #595959">From interviews with Brooklyn residents, we designed modular green roofs with IoT sensors, AI dashboards and a gamified community platform. I modeled a 6–10 year payback, up to 5°F of cooling and 50–60% rainfall capture. We placed 4th globally and won the #1 Employee Choice Award among 300+ teams.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px"><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">User research</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">IoT</span><span style="padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6">Business case</span></div>
<a href={`${base}case-studies/egis/`} style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Read the case study →</a>
</article>

</div>

<footer style="padding: 32px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Niranjana · Product Manager · New York, NY</footer>

</div>
</div>
</Layout>
